    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12092" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπήχ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>echo</i>: metaph. of <i>sayings repeated by rote,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				366c
			</span></i>; <i>faint echo,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐκεῖ ζωῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Alc.</u>
					p.99C.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				p.135C.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>echo,</i> 'ring', 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγαλοφροσύνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					9.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Medic.,
				<i>fracture from contre-coup,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				8
			</span></i>.</div>
